### Panel volume changes now flatten channel balance

`pactl set-sink-volume <sink> N%` sets every channel to N; Quickshell scaled them proportionally. **Impact:** on every sink, the slider, bar wheel and `h`/`l` now reset left/right balance (40%/60% set to 0.6 gives 60%/60%, was 48%/72%). The volume keys already do this.

**Suggested change:** pass one value per channel, or use pactl only where Quickshell drops the write.

